"""Build the game's lightweight, editable vector cover illustrations."""
from pathlib import Path
OUT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1] / 'public' / 'art'
INK = '#29465a'
def circle(x,y,r,fill,extra=''):
    return f'<circle cx="{x}" cy="{y}" r="{r}" fill="{fill}" {extra}/>'
def cloud(x,y,s=1):
    return f'<g transform="translate({x} {y}) scale({s})" fill="#fff" opacity=".85"><rect x="-42" y="0" width="90" height="25" rx="13"/><circle cx="-12" cy="0" r="23"/><circle cx="17" cy="-8" r="29"/></g>'
def star(x,y,s=1,color='#ffd668'):
    return f'<path transform="translate({x} {y}) scale({s})" d="M0-19 5-5 19 0 5 5 0 19-5 5-19 0-5-5Z" fill="{color}"/>'
def pin(x,y,s=1,rot=0):
    return f'''<g transform="translate({x} {y}) rotate({rot}) scale({s})" stroke="{INK}" stroke-width="4" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M-15-65C-37-95 36-97 15-65C9-48 15-35 25-15C39 15 30 34 0 34S-39 15-25-15C-15-35-9-48-15-65Z" fill="#fffdf5"/><path d="M-14-51H14M-17-40H17" stroke="#f47c70" stroke-width="8"/><path d="M-15-17Q-25 8-16 16" stroke="#e0eaf1" stroke-width="7" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>'''
def ball(x,y,r,fill='#7a80e6'):
    return circle(x,y+10,r,'#29465a', 'opacity=".12"')+circle(x,y,r,fill,f'stroke="{INK}" stroke-width="4"')+f'<ellipse cx="{x-r*.3}" cy="{y-r*.4}" rx="{r*.25}" ry="{r*.13}" fill="#fff" opacity=".45" transform="rotate(-30 {x-r*.3} {y-r*.4})"/>'
def wrap(bg,body):
    return f'<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 720 400"><rect width="720" height="400" fill="{bg}"/>{body}</svg>\n'
